    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ralmock as he takes on the trial of the storm. Go from jumping around his house trying not to touch the floor, to dodging rain drops as time it self slows down, to having a conversation with God in the ethereal inner workings of reality. Will you pass the trial or will you succumb to the frustration of dying over and over and over and over again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel the mystery:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play discover the secrets that hide in the seemingly normal house. The storm and the portals lead you deeper into this mysterious world where questions that are begging to be answered lay in secret.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/f07f5f2ba9824d24d6d56213b4154525.poster.avif?t=1745568103\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/f07f5f2ba9824d24d6d56213b4154525.webm?t=1745568103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/f07f5f2ba9824d24d6d56213b4154525.mp4?t=1745568103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour around the house:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump from\u00a0countertop to countertop as you try not to fall into the ever present lava that's waiting to consume you hungrily.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/ffef212766055d603e3fd0a79d1a62c7.poster.avif?t=1745568103\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/ffef212766055d603e3fd0a79d1a62c7.webm?t=1745568103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/ffef212766055d603e3fd0a79d1a62c7.mp4?t=1745568103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buttons:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buttons are everywhere and they always do something fun so press, press, press away!!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/f44e0e60c9b1d8257dd346885a17793f.poster.avif?t=1745568103\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/f44e0e60c9b1d8257dd346885a17793f.webm?t=1745568103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645520/extras/f44e0e60c9b1d8257dd346885a17793f.mp4?t=1745568103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
